<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BPI to post results Feb 26.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BPI to post results Feb 26.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Portugues de Investimento said it will issue its 1996 results on February 26, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
